#: Thesaurus.cpp:637
msgid ""
"<b>Error:</b> Failed to execute WordNet program 'wn'. WordNet has to be "
"installed on your computer if you want to use it, and 'wn' has to be in your "
"PATH. You can get WordNet at <a href=\"http://www.cogsci.princeton.edu/~wn/"
"\">http://www.cogsci.princeton.edu/~wn/</a>. Note that WordNet only supports "
"the English language."
msgstr ""
"<b>Erro:</b> Fallou a execución do programa de WordNet \"wn\". WordNet debe "
"estar instalado no seu sistema no caso de que o queira empregar, e ten que "
"estar no seu PATH. Pode obter WordNet en <a href=\"http://www.cogsci."
"princeton.edu/~wn/\"> http://www.cogsci.princeton.edu/~wn/</a>. Lémbrese que "
"WordNet só soporta a lingua inglesa."

